ck"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Close</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-performance-warning-confirm"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Understood</button></div></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-about-modal" class="wz-modal wz-about" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-about-title" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-max-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-about-title">StratOps Intelligence Brief</h2><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-about-close" aria-label="Close about dialog"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></header><nav class="wz-modal__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="About and policy tabs"><button class="wz-modal__tab is-active" type="button" data-tab="about" id="wz-about-tab-overview" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-overview" tabindex="0">Strategic Overview</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="capabilities" id="wz-about-tab-coverage" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-coverage" tabindex="-1">Domain Coverage</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="method" id="wz-about-tab-workflow" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-workflow" tabindex="-1">Intelligence Workflow</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="terms" id="wz-about-tab-compliance" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-compliance" tabindex="-1">Use & Compliance</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="policy" id="wz-about-tab-governance" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-governance" tabindex="-1">Data Governance</button></nav><section class="wz-modal-body"><div class="wz-content is-active" data-pane="about" id="wz-about-pane-overview" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-overview" aria-hidden="false"><h3>Strategic Overview</h3><p><strong>StratOps</strong>, powered by <strong><a href="https://battlespacex.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BattlespaceX</a></strong>, is a real-time, OSINT-based multi-domain intelligence visualization platform built to map operational tempo across air, land, sea, space, and cyberspace.</p><p>The platform emphasizes movement, escalation signals, and geographic context so users can interpret how a theater is evolving in near real time.</p><p>StratOps is part of the BattlespaceX ecosystem and is designed as a professional situational-awareness interface, not a general news dashboard.</p><h3>Platform Positioning</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Operational-first UX:</strong> layered map, tracker widgets, alert surfaces, and theater controls aligned to fast decision support</li><li><strong>Cross-domain picture:</strong> strike, aviation, naval, airspace, cyber, and anomaly-linked indicators in one interface</li><li><strong>High-density resilience:</strong> tuned to stay readable when event volume spikes across multiple regions</li><li><strong>Confidence-aware interpretation:</strong> supports iterative reading as data is refreshed, corrected, and re-ranked over time</li></ul><small>StratOps is an independent OSINT-informed monitoring platform and is not affiliated with any government, military, intelligence service, or emergency authority.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="capabilities" id="wz-about-pane-coverage" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-coverage" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Domain Coverage</h3><p>Coverage varies by source visibility, region, and active conditions, but StratOps is built to maintain a unified multi-domain operational picture where public signals are available.</p><h3>Core Intelligence Streams</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Strike layer:</strong> missile, rocket, drone/UAV, artillery, and air-delivered strike-linked incidents</li><li><strong>Air domain:</strong> live military aviation categories including fighter, AEW/AWACS, ISR/recon, tanker, transport, rotorcraft, and mission-specific airframes</li><li><strong>Naval domain:</strong> military maritime contacts with class-aware rendering where source quality supports classification</li><li><strong>Airspace layer:</strong> closure/restriction posture and conflict-adjacent aviation status shifts</li><li><strong>Cyber/strategic layer:</strong> public cyber and infrastructure stress indicators tied to conflict context</li></ul><h3>Visualization Stack</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Live globe rendering:</strong> aircraft/naval tracking, trajectories, and focused target views</li><li><strong>Operational widgets:</strong> escalation, theater intelligence, trackers, and layer control in one workflow</li><li><strong>Hotspot concentration:</strong> cluster-aware emphasis to prioritize dense activity zones</li><li><strong>Region-aware filtering:</strong> global and theater-specific perspective switching without context loss</li></ul><small>Coverage depends on public visibility, telemetry access, and live reporting quality at any given time.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="method" id="wz-about-pane-workflow" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-workflow" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Intelligence Workflow</h3><p>StratOps ingests publicly visible telemetry and structured OSINT signals, normalizes them to a common operational model, and renders them through a layered battlespace interface.</p><h3>Processing Sequence</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Collection:</strong> telemetry-visible movement, event feeds, alerts, and public conflict reporting</li><li><strong>Normalization:</strong> standardization into a shared event/track schema for cross-domain rendering</li><li><strong>Classification:</strong> role and activity inference for aircraft, naval, strike, and escalation-relevant signals</li><li><strong>Context filtering:</strong> scope by region, viewport, timeline, and layer state</li><li><strong>Operational rendering:</strong> combine overlays, widgets, hotspots, trackers, and alerts into one mission-like view</li><li><strong>Continuous revision:</strong> update, dedupe, and re-prioritize records as newer evidence arrives</li></ul><h3>Why Visuals Change Over Time</h3><p>Signals can be delayed, clustered, inferred, or reclassified as higher-confidence updates become available. StratOps is designed for situational awareness and pattern analysis, not as a replacement for primary-source confirmation.</p><small>The workflow is transparent at a system level while preserving protected source composition, ranking parameters, and internal enrichment logic.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="terms" id="wz-about-pane-compliance" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-compliance" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Use & Compliance</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Informational and analytical scope only:</strong> intended for awareness, research, and strategic interpretation.</li><li><strong>No tactical employment:</strong> must not be used for targeting, mission control, emergency command, navigation, or combat decisions.</li><li><strong>No guarantee of completeness:</strong> data can include latency, conflict, or uncertainty and may evolve after publication.</li><li><strong>Independent verification required:</strong> users are responsible for confirming any critical claim with authoritative channels.</li><li><strong>No official affiliation:</strong> BattlespaceX is independent and not a substitute for government, military, aviation, maritime, or civil-defense systems.</li><li><strong>Controlled use of content:</strong> unauthorized bulk extraction, mirroring, resale, or abuse is prohibited.</li><li><strong>Use-at-own-discretion:</strong> access implies acceptance of these limits.</li></ul><small>For verified alerts or official emergency direction, always refer to authorized agencies.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="policy" id="wz-about-pane-governance" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-governance" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Data Governance</h3><p>BattlespaceX balances platform transparency with source protection, system security, and responsible disclosure.</p><h3>Declared Transparency</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>StratOps uses publicly accessible telemetry, event reporting, and OSINT-style structured inputs</li><li>Signals may be normalized, grouped, delayed, filtered, or visually transformed before display</li><li>The platform provides an interpreted operational picture rather than unprocessed source output</li></ul><h3>Protected by Design</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Confidential upstream source composition</li><li>Internal weighting, confidence, and prioritization models</li><li>Private enrichment, matching, and ingestion workflows</li><li>Sensitive processing rules and anti-abuse controls</li></ul><h3>Operational Limitations</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Coverage depends on region, visibility, and telemetry/reporting availability</li><li>Not every conflict-relevant movement is publicly observable or persistently trackable</li><li>Absence of a signal does not confirm absence of activity</li><li>Some visuals represent normalized or inferred indicators, not confirmed ground truth</li></ul><small>StratOps intentionally discloses platform purpose and boundaries while protecting confidential source and system internals.</small></div></section></div></div></div></div><div id="wz-donate-modal" class="wz-donate-modal" aria-live="polite" hidden style="display: none !important"><button type="button" class="wz-donate-modal__close" id="wz-donate-close" aria-label="Dismiss donation prompt">✕</button><div class="wz-donate-modal__icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡</div><section class="wz-donate-modal__body"><h2 class="wz-donate-modal__title">Support StratOps</h2><p class="wz-donate-modal__text">StratOps is independent and free. Help keep it running — every contribution counts.</p></section><a id="wz-donate-link" href="https://donate.stripe.com/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_STRIPE_LINK" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary wz-donate-modal__btn" aria-label="Open donation page in new tab">Support the Mission</a></div></div><div id="site-loader" class="site-loader" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Loading Stratops interface"><span class="sr-only">Loading Stratops interface</span><div class="site-loader__inner"><img src="/assets/images/web/bx_preloader.gif" alt="" class="site-loader__gif"/></div></div><div id="wz-global-status" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">StratOps interface is loading...</div><section class="warzone-view is-active" id="view-strikes" data-view-panel="strikes" aria-labelledby="view-strikes-title"><h2 id="view-strikes-title" class="sr-only">Live multi-domain operations and battlespace visualization</h2><section class="warzone-map-shell" aria-label="Interactive global monitoring map"><div id="warzone-map-credits" class="warzone-map-credits" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="warzone-globe" class="warzone-globe" role="img" aria-label="3D globe showing open-source conflict activity, military movement, alerts, and monitoring overlays"></div></section><div id="warzone-ui-shell" class="warzone-ui-shell" hidden><nav class="wz-dock" aria-label="Map controls"><div class="wz-btn-container wz-dock__desktop-actions" role="toolbar" aria-label="Dock actions"><button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="counter" title="Toggle strike counter widget" aria-label="Toggle strike counter widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-dock-strike-counter-1" aria-hidden="true"></span> </span><span class="wz-dock__label">Counter</span></button> <button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="cyber" title="Toggle cyber status widget" aria-label="Toggle cyber status widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-