logo" width="380" height="100" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/></div></header><nav class="wz-modal__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="StratOps introduction sections"><button class="wz-modal__tab is-active" type="button" data-tab="intro" id="wz-intro-tab-intro" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="wz-intro-content-view" tabindex="0">Overview</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="capabilities" id="wz-intro-tab-capabilities" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-intro-capabilities" tabindex="-1">Operational Capabilities</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="terms" id="wz-intro-tab-terms" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-intro-terms" tabindex="-1">Rules of Engagement</button></nav><section class="wz-modal-body"><div id="wz-intro-content-view" class="wz-content is-active" data-pane="intro" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-intro-tab-intro" aria-hidden="false"><h1 id="wz-intro-title">Real-Time Multi-Domain Battlespace Intelligence</h1><p id="wz-intro-summary"><strong>StratOps</strong>, powered by <strong><a href="https://battlespacex.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BattlespaceX</a></strong>, is a real-time, multi-domain situational intelligence visualization platform that leverages OSINT to synthesize aggregated telemetry streams and event signals into a live, high-fidelity 3D layered battlespace spanning air, land, sea, space, and cyberspace. It supports tracking of military movements, assessment of escalation dynamics, and continuous interpretation of operational changes within a theater of operations, in near real time.</p></div><div id="wz-intro-login-view" class="wz-content" aria-hidden="true"><h2 id="wz-login-title">Sign In to StratOps</h2><p>Log in with your <strong>BattlespaceX</strong> account to unlock full capabilities.</p><p id="intro-auth-error" class="wz-error-container" hidden aria-live="assertive" role="alert"></p><form id="intro-auth-form" novalidate aria-labelledby="intro-auth-form-label"><span id="intro-auth-form-label" class="sr-only">Intro login form</span><div class="wz-form-container" role="group" aria-labelledby="intro-auth-fields-label"><span id="intro-auth-fields-label" class="sr-only">Login credentials</span><div class="wz-form-fieldbox"><label for="intro-auth-email">E-mail</label> <input id="intro-auth-email" type="email" autocomplete="username" inputmode="email" class="wz--input" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="intro-email-help"/> <span id="intro-email-help" class="sr-only">Enter your registered email address</span></div><div class="wz-form-fieldbox"><label for="intro-auth-password">Password</label> <input id="intro-auth-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" class="wz--input" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="intro-password-help"/> <span id="intro-password-help" class="sr-only">Enter your account password</span></div></div><div class="wz-check" for="intro-auth-remember"><input id="intro-auth-remember" type="checkbox"/> <span>Stay connected</span></div></form><div class="wz-footer" role="group" aria-label="Account creation option"><span>New to StratOps?</span> <button class="btn-secondary purple" type="button" onclick="window.location.href='https://www.battlespacex.com/register?returnUrl=https://stratops.battlespacex.com'" aria-label="Create a BattlespaceX account to access StratOps"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> <i class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-recon-intel-1" aria-hidden="true"></i> Create Account</button></div></div><div id="wz-intro-capabilities" class="wz-content" data-pane="capabilities" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-intro-tab-capabilities" aria-hidden="true"><section class="wz-capabilities-section" aria-labelledby="wz-capabilities-core"><h2 id="wz-capabilities-core" class="no-margin">Core Operational Capabilities</h2><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Real-Time Global Situational Awareness</h3><p>Monitor military activity, operational developments, strategic movements, escalation indicators, and emerging flashpoints from a single operational environment.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Unified Multi-Domain Intelligence View</h3><p>Analyze activity across air, land, sea, space, and cyberspace without switching between multiple platforms and data sources.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Integrated Intelligence Environment</h3><p>Correlate OSINT, telemetry, military infrastructure, geospatial intelligence, and operational events within a single operational picture.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Conflict &amp; Theater Analysis</h3><p>Focus on active conflicts, strategic regions, flashpoints, and theaters of interest using dedicated Region and Conflict Lens controls.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Operational Context &amp; Decision Support</h3><p>Understand how military assets, infrastructure, events, and geopolitical developments interact across a region rather than viewing isolated data points.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Military Activity Monitoring</h3><p>Track military aircraft, naval movements, strategic assets, and operational developments in near real time.</p></div></section><section class="wz-capabilities-section" aria-labelledby="wz-capabilities-advanced"><h2 id="wz-capabilities-advanced">Advanced Analysis Tools</h2><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Operational Overlay Suite</h3><p>Visualize radar coverage, threat rings, engagement ranges, area-of-influence zones, and force-projection capabilities.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Cross-Domain Activity Correlation</h3><p>Identify relationships between force movements, operational events, infrastructure, and strategic developments.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Focused Asset Tracking</h3><p>Inspect military aircraft and naval assets within their broader operational environment and surrounding activity.</p></div></section><section class="wz-capabilities-section" aria-labelledby="wz-capabilities-visualization"><h2 id="wz-capabilities-visualization">Visualization Experience</h2><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>Immersive 3D Battlespace Environment</h3><p>Explore military activity through a live, high-fidelity 3D operational environment designed for enhanced situational awareness.</p></div><div class="wz-capability-group"><h3>3D Military Asset Visualization</h3><p>View aircraft, naval vessels, and strategic assets using detailed 3D models that provide additional operational context.</p></div></section><section class="wz-capabilities-section" aria-labelledby="wz-capabilities-audience"><h2 id="wz-capabilities-audience">Built For</h2><p>OSINT analysts, defense researchers, journalists, security professionals, geopolitical observers, educators, and organizations requiring continuous monitoring of global security developments.</p></section></div><div id="wz-intro-terms" class="wz-content" data-pane="terms" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-intro-tab-terms" aria-hidden="true"><h2>Acceptance of These Rules</h2><p>By accessing, viewing, or using StratOps, you acknowledge and agree to these Rules of Engagement and Terms of Use.</p><p>If you do not agree with these terms, you must discontinue use of the platform.</p><h3>Information Sources</h3><p>StratOps relies on publicly available information, including but not limited to:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Open-source intelligence (OSINT)</li><li>Public aviation and maritime data</li><li>Government publications</li><li>News and media reporting</li><li>Publicly accessible telemetry and event feeds</li><li>Publicly available satellite and geospatial information</li><li>User-submitted and community-sourced observations where applicable</li></ul><p>Information displayed on the platform may be incomplete, delayed, inaccurate, misreported, disputed, or subsequently corrected.</p><p>Users are responsible for independently verifying any information before relying upon it.</p><h3>No Operational Authority</h3><p>StratOps does not issue:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Military orders</li><li>Security instructions</li><li>Emergency directives</li><li>Airspace advisories</li><li>Maritime navigation instructions</li><li>Evacuation notices</li><li>Civil defense guidance</li><li>Official threat warnings</li></ul><p>Nothing displayed on StratOps should be interpreted as official direction from any government, military, intelligence organization, emergency management agency, aviation authority, maritime authority, or public institution.</p><h3>Accuracy &amp; Reliability Disclaimer</h3><p>While reasonable efforts are made to maintain data quality and operational readability, StratOps makes no representation or warranty regarding:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Accuracy</li><li>Completeness</li><li>Reliability</li><li>Timeliness</li><li>Availability</li><li>Operational relevance</li></ul><p>Displayed tracks, events, alerts, incidents, classifications, visualizations, locations, movements, assessments, and indicators may contain errors or omissions.</p><p>Users assume full responsibility for any interpretation or use of information presented through the platform.</p><h3>Intelligence Classification Disclaimer</h3><p>All information presented within StratOps is derived from publicly accessible sources unless explicitly stated otherwise.</p><p>StratOps does not claim access to classified, restricted, protected, confidential, or government-controlled intelligence.</p><p>Visualizations, assessments, indicators, alerts, and classifications generated by the platform represent informational interpretations of open-source information and should not be considered authoritative intelligence products.</p><h3>Permitted Use</h3><p>Users may access and utilize StratOps for:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Research</li><li>Education</li><li>Journalism</li><li>Situational awareness</li><li>Academic work</li><li>Public-interest analysis</li><li>Security and geopolitical observation</li><li>Non-commercial review and evaluation</li></ul><p>All use must comply with applicable laws and regulations.</p><h3>Prohibited Activities</h3><p>Users may not:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Attempt unauthorized access to systems or infrastructure</li><li>Interfere with platform operations</li><li>Reverse engineer proprietary platform functionality</li><li>Circumvent security mechanisms</li><li>Use the platform to facilitate unlawful activity</li><li>Misrepresent StratOps content as official intelligence</li><li>Falsely claim affiliation with StratOps</li><li>Redistribute content in a misleading manner</li><li>Automate abusive collection of platform content</li></ul><p>StratOps reserves the right to restrict or terminate access for violations of these terms.</p><h3>Intellectual Property</h3><p>All StratOps branding, visual design, user interface elements, software components, graphics, logos, documentation, and proprietary content remain the property of BattlespaceX and/or their respective rights holders.</p><p>Nothing within these terms transfers ownership of any intellectual property to users.</p><h3>External Sources &amp; Third-Party Content</h3><p>StratOps may reference, aggregate, summarize, visualize, or display information originating from third-party sources.</p><p>Ownership of such third-party content remains with its respective owners.</p><p>StratOps does not assume responsibility for the accuracy, availability, legality, or continued existence of external information sources.</p><h3>Platform Availability</h3><p>StratOps is provided on an "as available" basis.</p><p>The platform may experience:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Maintenance periods</li><li>Service interruptions</li><li>Data delays</li><li>Feed outages</li><li>Mapping inaccuracies</li><li>Visualization issues</li><li>Technical failures</li></ul><p>Availability is not guaranteed.</p><h3>Limitation of Liability</h3><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, BattlespaceX, StratOps, its operators, contributors, partners, and affiliates shall not be liable for:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Direct damages</li><li>Indirect damages</li><li>Incidental damages</li><li>Consequential damages</li><li>Business interruption</li><li>Financial losses</li><li>Operational decisions</li><li>Security decisions</li><li>Personal or organizational actions taken in reliance upon platform content</li></ul><p>Use of StratOps is entirely at the user's own risk.</p><h3>Access Restriction &amp; Enforcement</h3><p>StratOps reserves the right to suspend, restrict, or permanently revoke access to any user or entity that:</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Violates these Rules of Engagement</li><li>Harms platform operations</li><li>Abuses platform resources</li><li>Engages in unlawful conduct</li><li>Threatens platform security or integrity</li></ul><p>Such actions may occur without prior notice.</p><h3>Modifications</h3><p>These Rules of Engagement may be updated, revised, or replaced at any time.</p><p>Continued use of StratOps following publication of revised terms constitutes acceptance of the updated version.</p><h3>Governing Principles</h3><p>StratOps is designed as an informational situational awareness platform intended to improve understanding of global events through open-source information visualization.</p><p>All information should be independently evaluated and verified before being used for operational, legal, financial, safety, governmental, military, or security-related decisions.</p></div></section><footer><div id="wz-hint" class="wz-hint"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-alert-1 color-grace-red" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Enter as a guest or <button type="button" id="wz-intro-open-login">Sign In</button> to unlock full capabilities.</span></div><div class="wz-action"><div class="wz-checks"><div class="wz-check" for="intro-disclaimer-check"><input id="intro-disclaimer-check" type="checkbox"/> <span>I understand that StratOps presents OSINT-informed monitoring data, is not an official warning network or classified intelligence product, and I accept the <a href="#wz-intro-terms" id="wz-intro-terms-link" class="wz-inline-action">Rules of Engagement</a>.</span></div></div><div class="wz-btns"><button id="wz-intro-back" class="btn-secondary white" type="button" hidden style="display:none"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Back</button> <button id="wz-intro-accept" class="btn-primary is-locked" type="button" disabled="disabled" aria-disabled="true" style="pointer-events:none"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> <span id="wz-intro-accept-label">Enter</span></button></div></div></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-region-modal" class="wz-modal wz-region" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-region-title" aria-describedby="wz-region-sub" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-max-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-region-title">Select Region</h2><p id="wz-region-sub">Choose an initial theater to begin monitoring.</p></header><section class="wz-region-grid" id="wz-region-modal-grid" role="listbox" aria-label="Available monitoring regions"></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-region-back"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Back</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-region-confirm" disabled="disabled"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Enter StratOps</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-region-outside-prompt" class="wz-modal wz-layer-warning wz-region-outside-prompt" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-region-outside-title" aria-describedby="wz-region-outside-summary wz-region-outside-detail" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-min-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><span class="wz-header-title"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-alert-2" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>Region Alert</h2></span><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-region-outside-close" aria-label="Close region alert"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body"><h3 id="wz-region-outside-title">Please Select Region</h3><p id="wz-region-outside-summary">Your current camera view is outside the selected monitoring region.</p><p id="wz-region-outside-detail" class="sr-only">Use Back to Region to return to the selected theater or Select Region to choose a different monitoring region.</p></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-region-outside-return"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Back to Region</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-region-outside-select"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Select Region</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-focus-warning-modal" class="wz-modal wz-layer-warning wz-focus-warning" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-focus-warning-title" aria-describedby="wz-focus-warning-summary" data-title="Focus Warning" data-aircraft-message="You are moving away from the focused aircraft. If you continue zooming out, this aircraft will be unfocused." data-naval-message="You are moving away from the focused naval asset. If you continue zooming out, this asset will be unfocused." data-stay-label="Stay Focused" data-unfocus-label="Unfocus Asset" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-min-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><span class="wz-header-title"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-alert-2" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2 id="wz-focus-warning-title">Focus Warning</h2></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body"><p id="wz-focus-warning-summary">You are moving away from the focused aircraft. If you continue zooming out, this aircraft will be unfocused.</p></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-focus-warning-stay"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Stay Focused</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-focus-warning-unfocus"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Unfocus Asset</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-pricing-modal" class="wz-modal wz-pricing" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-pricing-title" aria-describedby="wz-pricing-summary" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-max-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-pricing-title">StratOps Plans</h2><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" data-billing-close-pricing aria-label="Close pricing dialog"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body"><p id="wz-pricing-summary">Pick the level that matches how deeply you monitor the battlespace: quick viewing, daily analysis, or professional briefings.</p><p id="wz-pricing-current-plan" class="wz-pricing-current-plan" aria-live="polite">Current plan: Free preview</p><nav class="wz-modal__tabs wz-pricing-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing sections"><button class="wz-modal__tab is-active" type="button" data-pricing-tab="plans" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="wz-pricing-plans" tabindex="0">Plans</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-pricing-tab="compare" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-pricing-compare" tabindex="-1">Compare</button></nav><div id="wz-pricing-plans" class="wz-pricing-pane is-active" data-pricing-pane="plans" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="false"><div class="wz-pricing-grid" aria-label="StratOps subscription plans"><article class="wz-pricing-card"><h3>Basic</h3><p class="wz-pricing-card__summary">For casual monitoring and low-cost access to the live StratOps map.</p><p class="wz-pricing-card__price">$19/mo</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Live map access</li><li>Limited aircraft/naval tracker preview</li><li>Core event feed</li><li>Basic widgets</li><li>Mobile web access</li></ul><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" data-billing-checkout data-billing-plan="basic">Choose Basic</button></article><article class="wz-pricing-card is-featured"><h3>Advanced</h3><p class="wz-pricing-card__summary">For serious OSINT monitoring, full trackers, focus mode, and operational overlays.</p><p class="wz-pricing-card__price">$49/mo</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Everything in Basic</li><li>Full aircraft tracker</li><li>Full naval tracker</li><li>Focus mode</li><li>Region tools</li><li>Premium widgets and overlays</li><li>Focused asset trails + nearby 3D assets</li></ul><button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-billing-checkout data-billing-plan="advanced">Choose Advanced</button></article><article class="wz-pricing-card"><h3>Expert</h3><p class="wz-pricing-card__summary">For users who create repeatable views, local monitoring rules, and briefing files.</p><p class="wz-pricing-card__price">$149/mo</p><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Everything in Advanced</li><li>Local saved views</li><li>Local alert tools</li><li>Briefing export</li><li>Local backup export</li></ul><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" data-billing-checkout data-billing-plan="expert"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Choose Expert</button></article></div></div><section id="wz-pricing-compare" class="wz-plan-details wz-pricing-pane" data-pricing-pane="compare" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true" hidden><h3 class="wz-plan-details__heading">Compare plan details</h3><div class="wz-plan-details__grid"><article><h3>Basic</h3><p><strong>Limited tracker preview</strong> shows a small capped aircraft/naval list so users can understand the tracker without using the full workflow.</p><p><strong>Mobile web access</strong> means StratOps works in a phone or tablet browser. It is not an App Store app yet.</p><p><strong>Basic widgets</strong> are the core map/event panels needed for lightweight monitoring.</p></article><article><h3>Advanced</h3><p><strong>Full trackers</strong> unlock the complete aircraft and naval tracker workflows instead of the capped preview.</p><p><strong>Focus mode</strong> locks the camera onto an aircraft or naval asset while still allowing zoom control.</p><p><strong>Premium widgets and overlays</strong> include Airspace Status, Cyber Status, Escalation Meter, military bases, radar/threat ranges, and radar sweepers where available.</p><p><strong>Focused trails and nearby 3D assets</strong> show the focused asset path when history exists and keep nearby aircraft/naval assets visible in 3D.</p></article><article><h3>Expert</h3><p><strong>Local saved views</strong> save camera, region, layer, and widget state on this computer/browser.</p><p><strong>Local alert tools</strong> match visible events by keyword, category, and severity while the browser is open.</p><p><strong>Briefing export</strong> copies or downloads a Markdown briefing from the current visible event snapshot.</p><p><strong>Local backup export</strong> downloads saved views and alert rules as a JSON file. Cloud sync can become a paid add-on later.</p></article></div></section><small>Pricing is shown in U.S. dollars and excludes applicable taxes unless otherwise stated. Any required taxes will be calculated during checkout. A Battlespacex account is required to purchase and manage a subscription.</small><p id="wz-pricing-checkout-status" class="wz-error-container" hidden aria-live="polite"></p></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-billing-checkout data-billing-plan="advanced"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Start Advanced</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-expert-tools-modal" class="wz-modal wz-expert-tools" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-expert-tools-title" aria-describedby="wz-expert-tools-summary" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-max-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-expert-tools-title">Expert Tools</h2><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" data-expert-tools-close aria-label="Close Expert tools"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><nav class="wz-modal__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Expert tool sections"><button class="wz-modal__tab is-active" type="button" data-expert-tab="views" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="wz-expert-views" tabindex="0">Saved Views</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-expert-tab="alerts" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-expert-alerts" tabindex="-1">Alert Rules</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-expert-tab="briefing" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-expert-briefing" tabindex="-1">Briefing Export</button></nav><section class="wz-modal-body"><p id="wz-expert-tools-summary" class="wz-expert-summary">Browser-local Expert workflows for analysis, snapshots, and monitoring rules.</p><div id="wz-expert-views" class="wz-content is-active" data-expert-pane="views" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="false"><p class="wz-expert-local-note">Local save keeps views on this browser and costs nothing in cloud storage. Cloud sync will be a paid add-on later for users who want cross-device backup.</p><div class="wz-expert-form"><label for="wz-saved-view-name">View name</label><div class="wz-expert-inline"><input id="wz-saved-view-name" class="wz--input" maxlength="64" placeholder="Current theater view"/> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-saved-view-save"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Save View</button> <button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-expert-backup-download"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Download Backup</button></div></div><p id="wz-saved-view-status" class="wz-expert-status" hidden aria-live="polite"></p><div id="wz-saved-views-list" class="wz-expert-list"></div></div><div id="wz-expert-alerts" class="wz-content" data-expert-pane="alerts" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true"><p class="wz-expert-local-note">Local alert rules run only while this browser is open. Server-side alerts, email alerts, and cloud sync can be offered later as paid usage add-ons.</p><div class="wz-expert-form wz-expert-form--grid"><div><label for="wz-alert-keyword">Keyword</label> <input id="wz-alert-keyword" class="wz--input" maxlength="60" placeholder="drone, convoy, siren..."/></div><div><label for="wz-alert-category">Category</label> <select id="wz-alert-category" class="wz--input"><option value="any">Any category</option><option value="alert">Alert</option><option value="strike">Strike</option><option value="military">Military</option><option value="cyber">Cyber</option><option value="thermal">Thermal</option><option value="recon">Recon</option></select></div><div><label for="wz-alert-severity">Minimum severity</label> <select id="wz-alert-severity" class="wz--input"><option value="any">Any severity</option><option value="low">Low</option><option value="medium">Medium</option><option value="high">High</option><option value="critical">Critical</option></select></div><button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-alert-rule-add"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Add Rule</button></div><p id="wz-alert-rule-status" class="wz-expert-status" hidden aria-live="polite"></p><div class="wz-expert-columns"><div><h3>Rules</h3><div id="wz-alert-rules-list" class="wz-expert-list"></div></div><div><h3>Current Matches</h3><div id="wz-alert-matches-list" class="wz-expert-list"></div></div></div></div><div id="wz-expert-briefing" class="wz-content" data-expert-pane="briefing" role="tabpanel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="wz-expert-briefing-actions"><button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-briefing-copy"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Copy Briefing</button> <button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-briefing-download"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Download Briefing</button></div><p id="wz-briefing-status" class="wz-expert-status" hidden aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" data-expert-tools-close><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Close</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-login-modal" class="wz-modal wz-login" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-login-modal-title" aria-describedby="wz-login-summary" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-min-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-login-modal-title">Sign In to StratOps</h2><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-login-close" aria-label="Close login dialog"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body is-active"><div id="wz-login-summary"><p id="auth-guest-copy">Log in with your <strong>BattlespaceX</strong> account to unlock full capabilities.</p><p id="auth-authed-copy" hidden>You are already logged in to BattlespaceX. Continue into StratOps.</p><p id="auth-authed-user" class="wz-auth-user" hidden aria-live="polite"></p><p id="auth-error" class="wz-error-container" hidden aria-live="assertive" role="alert"></p><form id="auth-login-form" novalidate aria-labelledby="wz-login-modal-title"><div id="auth-login-fields" class="wz-form-container" role="group" aria-labelledby="auth-login-fields-label"><span id="auth-login-fields-label" class="sr-only">Login credentials</span><div class="wz-form-fieldbox"><label for="auth-email">E-mail</label> <input id="auth-email" type="email" autocomplete="username" inputmode="email" class="wz--input" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="email-help"/> <span id="email-help" class="sr-only">Enter your registered email address</span></div><div class="wz-form-fieldbox"><label for="auth-password">Password</label> <input id="auth-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" class="wz--input" required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="password-help"/> <span id="password-help" class="sr-only">Enter your account password</span></div></div><div class="wz-check" for="auth-remember"><input id="auth-remember" type="checkbox"/> <span>Stay connected</span></div><button id="auth-login-btn" class="btn-primary" type="button" data-mode="guest" aria-disabled="false"><span class="wz-auth-btn__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span id="auth-login-btn-text">Log In</span></button></form></div><div role="group" aria-label="Account creation option"><span>New to StratOps?</span> <button id="auth-create-account" class="btn-secondary purple" type="button" onclick="window.location.href='https://www.battlespacex.com/register?returnUrl=https://stratops.battlespacex.com'" aria-label="Create a BattlespaceX account to access StratOps"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> <i class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-recon-intel-1" aria-hidden="true"></i> Create Account</button></div></section></div></div></div><div id="wz-layer-warning-modal" class="wz-modal wz-layer-warning" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-layer-warning-title" aria-describedby="wz-layer-warning-summary wz-layer-warning-detail" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-min-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><span class="wz-header-title"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-alert-2" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>Alert</h2></span><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-layer-warning-close" aria-label="Close performance warning"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body"><h3 id="wz-layer-warning-title">High-Load Alert</h3><p id="wz-layer-warning-summary"></p><p id="wz-layer-warning-detail" class="no-margin"></p></section><footer><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-layer-warning-back"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Back</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-layer-warning-confirm"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Understood</button></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-performance-warning-modal" class="wz-modal wz-layer-warning wz-performance-warning" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-performance-warning-title" aria-describedby="wz-performance-warning-summary wz-performance-warning-detail" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-min-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><span class="wz-header-title"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-assets-alert-2" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>Performance Alert</h2></span><span class="wz-close-modal"><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-performance-warning-close" aria-label="Close performance advisory"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></span></header><section class="wz-modal-body"><h3 id="wz-performance-warning-title">Adaptive Quality Mode Enabled</h3><p id="wz-performance-warning-summary"></p><p id="wz-performance-warning-detail"></p><ul id="wz-performance-warning-env" class="wz-performance-warning__env" aria-label="Detected system metrics"></ul></section><footer><div class="wz-check" for="wz-performance-warning-optout"><input id="wz-performance-warning-optout" type="checkbox"/> <span>Don't show this advisory again on this browser.</span></div><div class="wz-btns"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary white" id="wz-performance-warning-back"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Close</button> <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="wz-performance-warning-confirm"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Understood</button></div></footer></div></div></div><div id="wz-about-modal" class="wz-modal wz-about" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wz-about-title" hidden><div class="wz-modal-box wz-max-modal"><div class="wz-modal-inner"><header><h2 id="wz-about-title">StratOps Intelligence Brief</h2><button type="button" class="static-icon" id="wz-about-close" aria-label="Close about dialog"><span class="stratops-ico-close-1" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></header><nav class="wz-modal__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="About and policy tabs"><button class="wz-modal__tab is-active" type="button" data-tab="about" id="wz-about-tab-overview" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-overview" tabindex="0">Strategic Overview</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="capabilities" id="wz-about-tab-coverage" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-coverage" tabindex="-1">Domain Coverage</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="method" id="wz-about-tab-workflow" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-workflow" tabindex="-1">Intelligence Workflow</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="terms" id="wz-about-tab-compliance" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-compliance" tabindex="-1">Use & Compliance</button> <button class="wz-modal__tab" type="button" data-tab="policy" id="wz-about-tab-governance" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="wz-about-pane-governance" tabindex="-1">Data Governance</button></nav><section class="wz-modal-body"><div class="wz-content is-active" data-pane="about" id="wz-about-pane-overview" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-overview" aria-hidden="false"><h3>Strategic Overview</h3><p><strong>StratOps</strong>, powered by <strong><a href="https://battlespacex.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BattlespaceX</a></strong>, is a real-time, OSINT-based multi-domain intelligence visualization platform built to map operational tempo across air, land, sea, space, and cyberspace.</p><p>The platform emphasizes movement, escalation signals, and geographic context so users can interpret how a theater is evolving in near real time.</p><p>StratOps is part of the BattlespaceX ecosystem and is designed as a professional situational-awareness interface, not a general news dashboard.</p><h3>Platform Positioning</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Operational-first UX:</strong> layered map, tracker widgets, alert surfaces, and theater controls aligned to fast decision support</li><li><strong>Cross-domain picture:</strong> strike, aviation, naval, airspace, cyber, and anomaly-linked indicators in one interface</li><li><strong>High-density resilience:</strong> tuned to stay readable when event volume spikes across multiple regions</li><li><strong>Confidence-aware interpretation:</strong> supports iterative reading as data is refreshed, corrected, and re-ranked over time</li></ul><small>StratOps is an independent OSINT-informed monitoring platform and is not affiliated with any government, military, intelligence service, or emergency authority.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="capabilities" id="wz-about-pane-coverage" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-coverage" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Domain Coverage</h3><p>Coverage varies by source visibility, region, and active conditions, but StratOps is built to maintain a unified multi-domain operational picture where public signals are available.</p><h3>Core Intelligence Streams</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Strike layer:</strong> missile, rocket, drone/UAV, artillery, and air-delivered strike-linked incidents</li><li><strong>Air domain:</strong> live military aviation categories including fighter, AEW/AWACS, ISR/recon, tanker, transport, rotorcraft, and mission-specific airframes</li><li><strong>Naval domain:</strong> military maritime contacts with class-aware rendering where source quality supports classification</li><li><strong>Airspace layer:</strong> closure/restriction posture and conflict-adjacent aviation status shifts</li><li><strong>Cyber/strategic layer:</strong> public cyber and infrastructure stress indicators tied to conflict context</li></ul><h3>Visualization Stack</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Live globe rendering:</strong> aircraft/naval tracking, trajectories, and focused target views</li><li><strong>Operational widgets:</strong> escalation, theater intelligence, trackers, and layer control in one workflow</li><li><strong>Hotspot concentration:</strong> cluster-aware emphasis to prioritize dense activity zones</li><li><strong>Region-aware filtering:</strong> global and theater-specific perspective switching without context loss</li></ul><small>Coverage depends on public visibility, telemetry access, and live reporting quality at any given time.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="method" id="wz-about-pane-workflow" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-workflow" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Intelligence Workflow</h3><p>StratOps ingests publicly visible telemetry and structured OSINT signals, normalizes them to a common operational model, and renders them through a layered battlespace interface.</p><h3>Processing Sequence</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Collection:</strong> telemetry-visible movement, event feeds, alerts, and public conflict reporting</li><li><strong>Normalization:</strong> standardization into a shared event/track schema for cross-domain rendering</li><li><strong>Classification:</strong> role and activity inference for aircraft, naval, strike, and escalation-relevant signals</li><li><strong>Context filtering:</strong> scope by region, viewport, timeline, and layer state</li><li><strong>Operational rendering:</strong> combine overlays, widgets, hotspots, trackers, and alerts into one mission-like view</li><li><strong>Continuous revision:</strong> update, dedupe, and re-prioritize records as newer evidence arrives</li></ul><h3>Why Visuals Change Over Time</h3><p>Signals can be delayed, clustered, inferred, or reclassified as higher-confidence updates become available. StratOps is designed for situational awareness and pattern analysis, not as a replacement for primary-source confirmation.</p><small>The workflow is transparent at a system level while preserving protected source composition, ranking parameters, and internal enrichment logic.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="terms" id="wz-about-pane-compliance" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-compliance" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Use & Compliance</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li><strong>Informational and analytical scope only:</strong> intended for awareness, research, and strategic interpretation.</li><li><strong>No tactical employment:</strong> must not be used for targeting, mission control, emergency command, navigation, or combat decisions.</li><li><strong>No guarantee of completeness:</strong> data can include latency, conflict, or uncertainty and may evolve after publication.</li><li><strong>Independent verification required:</strong> users are responsible for confirming any critical claim with authoritative channels.</li><li><strong>No official affiliation:</strong> BattlespaceX is independent and not a substitute for government, military, aviation, maritime, or civil-defense systems.</li><li><strong>Controlled use of content:</strong> unauthorized bulk extraction, mirroring, resale, or abuse is prohibited.</li><li><strong>Use-at-own-discretion:</strong> access implies acceptance of these limits.</li></ul><small>For verified alerts or official emergency direction, always refer to authorized agencies.</small></div><div class="wz-content" data-pane="policy" id="wz-about-pane-governance" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="wz-about-tab-governance" aria-hidden="true"><h3>Data Governance</h3><p>BattlespaceX balances platform transparency with source protection, system security, and responsible disclosure.</p><h3>Declared Transparency</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>StratOps uses publicly accessible telemetry, event reporting, and OSINT-style structured inputs</li><li>Signals may be normalized, grouped, delayed, filtered, or visually transformed before display</li><li>The platform provides an interpreted operational picture rather than unprocessed source output</li></ul><h3>Protected by Design</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Confidential upstream source composition</li><li>Internal weighting, confidence, and prioritization models</li><li>Private enrichment, matching, and ingestion workflows</li><li>Sensitive processing rules and anti-abuse controls</li></ul><h3>Operational Limitations</h3><ul class="wz-list-view"><li>Coverage depends on region, visibility, and telemetry/reporting availability</li><li>Not every conflict-relevant movement is publicly observable or persistently trackable</li><li>Absence of a signal does not confirm absence of activity</li><li>Some visuals represent normalized or inferred indicators, not confirmed ground truth</li></ul><small>StratOps intentionally discloses platform purpose and boundaries while protecting confidential source and system internals.</small></div></section></div></div></div></div><div id="wz-donate-modal" class="wz-donate-modal" aria-live="polite" hidden style="display: none !important"><button type="button" class="wz-donate-modal__close" id="wz-donate-close" aria-label="Dismiss donation prompt">✕</button><div class="wz-donate-modal__icon" aria-hidden="true">STRATOPS</div><section class="wz-donate-modal__body" aria-labelledby="wz-supporter-title"><h2 id="wz-supporter-title" class="wz-donate-modal__title">Founding Supporter Program</h2><p class="wz-donate-modal__text">StratOps is independently built and currently operating as an early access platform. Running a real-time operational intelligence environment requires ongoing development, infrastructure, and future commercial data licensing.</p><p class="wz-donate-modal__text">Supporter access is not a commercial data subscription. Supporters are helping the platform grow while StratOps works toward proper licensing and future premium plans.</p><h3 id="wz-support-why" class="wz-donate-modal__heading">Why Support StratOps?</h3><p class="wz-donate-modal__text">StratOps is built independently and requires ongoing resources to maintain, improve, and expand. Support helps cover infrastructure, development, and future commercial data licensing so the platform can grow responsibly.</p><h3 class="wz-donate-modal__heading">What Your Support Helps Fund</h3><ul class="wz-list-view wz-donate-modal__list"><li>Platform infrastructure and performance improvements</li><li>Continued development of operational monitoring tools</li><li>Future commercial aircraft data licensing</li><li>Future maritime and naval data licensing</li><li>Expanded OSINT and event-monitoring capabilities</li><li>Better alerting, export, and briefing workflows</li></ul><h3 class="wz-donate-modal__heading">Supporter Benefits</h3><ul class="wz-list-view wz-donate-modal__list"><li>Help shape StratOps during early access</li><li>Early visibility into experimental capabilities</li><li>Priority feedback consideration</li><li>Founding Supporter recognition where appropriate</li><li>Early access to future premium features when licensing allows</li></ul><p class="wz-donate-modal__note"><strong>Important note:</strong> Supporter access is not a commercial data subscription. Paid premium plans may be introduced later only after licensing and platform readiness requirements are in place.</p></section><div class="wz-donate-modal__actions"><a id="wz-donate-link" href="/billing/support" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary wz-donate-modal__btn" aria-label="Open supporter page in new tab">Support StratOps </a><a href="#wz-support-why" class="btn-secondary white wz-donate-modal__btn">Why Support Matters</a></div></div></div><div id="site-loader" class="site-loader" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Loading Stratops interface"><span class="sr-only">Loading Stratops interface</span><div class="site-loader__inner"><img src="/assets/images/web/bx_preloader.gif" alt="" class="site-loader__gif"/></div></div><div id="wz-global-status" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">StratOps interface is loading...</div><section class="warzone-view is-active" id="view-strikes" data-view-panel="strikes" aria-labelledby="view-strikes-title"><h2 id="view-strikes-title" class="sr-only">Live multi-domain operations and battlespace visualization</h2><section class="warzone-map-shell" aria-label="Interactive global monitoring map"><div id="warzone-map-credits" class="warzone-map-credits" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="warzone-globe" class="warzone-globe" role="img" aria-label="3D globe showing open-source conflict activity, military movement, alerts, and monitoring overlays"></div></section><div id="warzone-ui-shell" class="warzone-ui-shell" hidden><nav class="wz-dock" aria-label="Map controls"><div class="wz-btn-container wz-dock__desktop-actions" role="toolbar" aria-label="Dock actions"><button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="counter" title="Toggle strike counter widget" aria-label="Toggle strike counter widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-dock-strike-counter-1" aria-hidden="true"></span> </span><span class="wz-dock__label">Counter</span></button> <button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="cyber" data-plan-feature="premiumWidgets" title="Toggle cyber status widget" aria-label="Toggle cyber status widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-dock-cyberspace-1" aria-hidden="true"></span> </span><span class="wz-dock__label">Cyber</span></button> <button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="airspace" data-plan-feature="premiumWidgets" title="Toggle airspace status widget" aria-label="Toggle airspace status widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-dock-airspace-1" aria-hidden="true"></span> </span><span class="wz-dock__label">Airspace</span></button> <button class="wz-dock__btn wz-dock__btn--widget" type="button" data-dock-widget="aircraft" title="Toggle aircraft tracker widget" aria-label="Toggle aircraft tracker widget"><span class="wz-dock__icon"><span class="static-icon stratops-ico-dock-air-tracker-1" aria-hidden="true"></span> </span><span class="wz-dock__label">Aircraft Tracker</span